John E Clifford wrote:
>there is no middle ground: I am interested or
>not.

I disagree.  There's a middle ground.  {a'u} means I particularly wish
to learn more about the subject.  {a'unai} means I particularly wish
to not learn more about the subject.  {a'ucu'i} means I have no strong
feeling about it: I don't care whether I learn more about it.

